WEBVTT

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.110
For Kamakura... For Kamakura...

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.520
What the hell is this!?

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.030
<i>Wait a minute... Let me remember...</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:57.280
<i>What exactly just happened!?</i>

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.410
Thank you for riding with us.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.540
This is a special express train.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.840
It will go all the way to its terminus without stopping. Please take note.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.000
"Dear my beloved G4-sama..."

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.720
"I have planted a bomb at the Great Kamakura Detective."

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:20.640
"If you want to disarm the bomb, ride the Eno special express train and find me."

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.970
"I'll be wholeheartedly awaiting your arrival."

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:27.560
A giant statue serves as the centerpiece of the Detective Expo.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.480
If it's destroyed, our world fair might be screwed up.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:33.150
Damn those terrorists! They're always giving us trouble.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.570
Even if the Detective Fair were to be canceled...

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:39.030
No, even if they blast the whole fair into bits and pieces, I'm okay with that,

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:42.700
but as a police officer, I cannot overlook any breach of the law!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.790
We made it!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.920
Just in time!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.290
Milky Holmes!?

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.380
Oh, Kokoro-chan!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.420
Don't call me that!

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.010
Then, I tied Sherlock up. After that...

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:06.020
Please don't pinch my fingers with pencils!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.450
We're going to see the Great Detective at Kamakura!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.830
Really?

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:30.210
But I didn't think that <i>that</i>, of all things, would happen...

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.710
Kokoro was going to find out who the suspect was, but...

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.000
Wait a minute!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.260
I'm all beaten up already!?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.180
Why am I unconscious all of a sudden!?

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.430
Lots of things happened after we set off!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.680
Tell me about those "things" that happened!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.770
Now, now. Hold your horses.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.390
You'll understand if you listen to our story.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:55.070
And so, we set off to find the suspect who sent the advance notice.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.570
How do we find him?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:59.320
I was thinking to get a detective to help if there were any here...

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:01.950
No choice, then.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.530
We'll have to find the suspect without Kokoro-san.

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:05.530
I guess so.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.330
I think we should start by asking around.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.410
You're right.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.210
Let's start from the rearmost carriage.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.900
What are you doing?

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.800
We overheard everything you just said.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.470
Us detectives will help you out!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:30.600
Let's protect Kamakura's Great Detective.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.940
Milky Holmes, dispatch!

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.520
Please wait!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.030
The next carriage has five passengers.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.910
So the culprit who sent the notice must be one of them.

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:46.240
We just need to find the one that's the most suspicious.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.910
Piece of cake!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.420
<i>Everyone</i>  here looks suspicious...

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.470
The coat guy is the flasher we caught last time.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.640
The guy who's holding a cooler box is Irene's father, right?

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.220
What's he doing with it?

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.850
I know who the culprit is!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.770
He is...

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.230
You!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.520
You make no sense-oink!

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.820
Heave!

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.570
How's her condition?

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.160
Horrible. She's out cold.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.740
W-Will she be fine?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.290
Hey!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.580
Wake up!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.750
Wake up~!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.370
Wake up, dammit!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.540
Try punching her?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:38.710
Okay.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.340
<i>The breeze feels so nice...</i>

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:46.800
<i>And it's so beautiful outside...</i>

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.850
A bird!

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.100
W-Water!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.020
Herc-san, are you okay!?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.020
What were you thinking!? She's all drenched now!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.230
No response?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.530
That's not good. You have to change!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.150
Change!?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.280
Here, wear this.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.490
Chest!

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:19.420
Chest! Chest! Chest! Chest!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.010
Toasted seaweed...

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.090
Strip.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:28.220
You want this little girl too!?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.390
You really are a gentleman.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.810
I'm glad that someone kindly lent you clothes.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.610
Yes...

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:41.650
We've got trouble!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:45.110
Someone cleaned out all the meal boxes when I wasn't looking!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.610
Terrible...

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.280
Who could have done this?

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.950
The culprit is you!

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.950
N-Not me-oink!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.660
I've only been eating lard!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.460
No use lying!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:03.250
I won't forgive anyone who eats delicious bittersweet mackerel sushi all by himself!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:07.260
More importantly, *burp* there's not enough food in train meal boxes!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.800
That means you were forced to eat all ten boxes, *burp* right!?

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.720
I did nothing wrong!

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.890
That delicious *burp*mackerel tempted me―

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:27.650
It's the sea!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:31.240
I can see Enoshima~!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.080
I can see Eboushi Rock in the distance.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.830
By the way, what time is it now?

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.700
About 17:00 now.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.750
Where am I...

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.880
Let's wake Kokoro-cha―

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:49.880
Oh no!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.050
Kokoro-chan is gone!

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.390
Strange. Where did she go?

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.640
Maybe she was kidnapped.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:58.600
Kidnapped!?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:01.850
The person who'll get the most profit from abducting Akechi-san...

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.650
Was it just pure coincidence that you're riding on this train?

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.150
Your identity has been exposed!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.860
I said no-oink!

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:12.910
Hey.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.580
Papa Irene, do you know where Kokoro―

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.080
I'm innocent!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.580
There is nothing suspicious inside my box!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.080
Hirano.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:23.790
Got it.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.590
Heave-ho!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.760
It looks heavy! What's inside?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.550
Let's see.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.230
There's something on her face...

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.480
Looks delicious!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.690
Let's boil it up!

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.400
Sher!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.450
You're the best.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.280
What's that monster!?

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:00.040
I-I picked it up at the horseshoe crab site!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:04.500
I kept it, and it kept growing, to the point where it seemed really dangerous!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:09.800
I thought, "Wasn't this a horseshoe crab?" and I got scared.
I just wanted to throw it back in the sea!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:13.380
Horseshoe crabs are a protected species. Keeping them as pets is illegal.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.680
We've got a bigger problem right now!

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.690
Kokoro really is too cute!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.620
So cute...

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:49.380
Those clothes really look good on Kokoro, huh?

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.000
Tsugiko, try and wear it.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.090
Me? No way!

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.590
These frilly clothes won't fit me.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.390
They will!

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:57.800
What?

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:02.100
With your beauty, you'll look good in any clothes.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.060
You need to have more confidence in yourself!

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.440
Tsugiko-san, you're wonderful!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:08.310
But I'd love to see you all dressed up cute!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.610
Eh, really?

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.940
Here, Tsugiko.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:23.080
Twinkle! Sparkle! Glitter!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.160
Beautiful beautiful eternal!

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.920
Lovely memory pretty!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:31.210
I'll catch your pure pure heart!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.500
Rawr!

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.840
You're wonderful! You're cute!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.260
I didn't expect you to actually wear it!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.050
You're so cute that I almost fainted!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.930
You're a real challenger, Zenigata-san.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.810
Y-You're k-killing me...!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.900
You can't do this!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.230
Calm down!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.650
Huh? What's this?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.820
Did someone forget it?

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.740
Tick, tick, tick...

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.580
Cherry Bomb!?

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.960
This is a bomb!!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.000
I'm still in my underwear, you know!!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.690
Saku, any contact from the bomb squad?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:32.400
The bomb disarming robot is on its way.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.440
But I don't know when it'll arrive.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.900
<i>If the bomb were to explode...</i>

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:46.330
Sher! Nero! Herc!!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.430
I won't let that happen!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:03.720
Cordelia-san?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.850
I'll be the sacrifice.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:12.150
Everyone, live long and prosper!!

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.980
I'll live long and prosper for you!

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.400
Don't lose your way to heaven!

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.150
Wait!

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.370
I won't forget about Cordelia-san for the meantime!

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.540
Please rest in peace.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.660
For Cordelia, who sacrificed her life for her companions,

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.790
salute!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:37.210
Hey! Stop right there!!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.260
That's...

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.840
Cordelia-san is chasing us while holding the bomb!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.720
Don't come back!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.850
Eat this!!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.480
We live together, we die together!!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.190
Thanks for the lift!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.110
You're...!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:02.030
Bomb disarming robot, Poporo Mark II.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.280
Naischuu meechuu!

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.780
Right, begin bomb disarmament.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.830
Go! Poporo!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.790
Go!!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.460
Start disarming already!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.130
Gulp!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.310
Kokoro's merchandise?

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:37.650
So this is Kokoro's bag?

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.400
It isn't a bomb.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.030
But I'm sure I heard a timer ticking.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.530
You're talking about this?

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:45.570
Kokoro-doodle-doo!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:50.450
I am Akechi Kokoro, a genius and beautiful Harvard graduate with an IQ of 14,000,000,000!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.250
Looks good to me.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.380
Poporo-chan, you're so cute!

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:00.050
Good for you, Poporo-chan!

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:10.060
Don't call me Poporo-chan!

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.390
Look! It's Kamakura's Great Detective!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.020
It's so big!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.380
We're almost at the terminus, Kamakura Station.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:19.940
Oh god, the terminus!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.780
I completely forgot to look for clues!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.280
Just leave it to me!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.200
Don't tell me you know who the culprit is?

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.450
No idea!

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.820
Figures.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.330
But we are detectives.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.700
We'll definitely find the culprit.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.960
Milky Holmes, dispatch!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.050
Oh, the rain in Saint-Tropez!

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.760
Love in Saint-Tropez!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.720
Mommy!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:57.850
This isn't a bomb.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.700
Don't call me Poporo-chan! Don't call―

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.080
That was wonderful.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.290
I've got it!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:20.000
The culprit is among us!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.840
The culprit is you!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.800
I already said no-oink!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.840
I can't bear it anymore-oink!!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.560
Looks like you're wrong.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.850
The culprit is among us!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.850
The culprit is you!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.020
Oh, I think I'll just ignore you now.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:48.820
My mother said to pick the very best and you are so it!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:49.910
You're the culprit!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.740
What!? No, no!

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.990
I'm no culprit.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.910
You can't fool me with your English.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.540
Oh my god!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.170
I'm sorry!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.080
I did it!

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.080
The train conductor!?

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.880
As I thought! You're the culprit!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:06.600
Hey!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:10.720
To tell you the truth, I'm a big fan of Akechi Kokoro!

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:18.220
I idolize her so much that I sent her a letter that I would plant a bomb to destroy the Great Kamakura Detective.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:21.810
That way, I would be able ride the same train as her!

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.190
You just spilled the beans without being asked to.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.940
Not too surprising.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.490
So that attaché case was...

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:32.030
It's my collection of Kokoro-chan goods.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:37.490
I'm just a train conductor, a ordinary die-hard fan of Kokoro-chan, and yet I...

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.040
Disgusting! And you even sent an advance notice!?

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:43.670
It's all my fault that it turned out like this!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.750
I'm at fault!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.510
Mr. Conductor, please raise your head.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:54.180
Akechi-san's bad luck was only the result of some unfortunate coincidences.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.680
Nobody is at fault.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.640
Condemn the offense, but pity the offender!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.850
Kokoro-chan will forgive you!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:06.110
Thank you so much!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.780
With this, the close is cased!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.650
Really?

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:33.130
What the hell is this!?

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.640
And that's the story.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:39.470
We caught the culprit who sent the notice, so you can rest easy!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:41.140
This is the switch for the bomb.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:45.560
Pressing the red button will cause the bomb to explode, so please do not press it!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.860
Understood. We will never press the red button!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.780
Time to go.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.700
Oh, right.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:57.160
Your names... Please tell me your names.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.120
We're Milky Holmes!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.450
We're detectives!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.580
Who cares about that culprit!?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:09.920
According to your story, that stupid Poporo beat the hell outta me!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:13.550
And who was it that knocked me unconscious first!?

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.010
Oh, that's easy!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.850
We made it!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.520
Just in time!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.150
Milky Holmes!?

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.020
Oh, Kokoro-chan!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.030
Don't call me that!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.110
Oops.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.320
Are you okay?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.830
I-I'm sorry!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.160
Ow!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.710
My Mega Cheeto!!

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.500
Yowch!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.340
My racket!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.680
The banana peel that I was going to throw away later!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.980
Banana~

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:17.030
Oh, Kokoro-chan! Who did this to you!?

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.860
There you have it!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.160
This is NOT a laughing matter!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.160
You're such a stud.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.670
Rage!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:35.090
I was going to magnificently solve the case but those bastards just had to barge in!

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:38.420
At least we protected the Great Kamakura Detective.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.630
Happy ending.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:43.390
How do I describe this...

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:46.060
This feeling that I've forgotten...

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.980
It excites me and warms me up!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:53.020
Solving a case feels so good...

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.520
Is this called "being a detective"?

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:56.030
That's right.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.070
This is the essence of being a detective!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:03.450
Catching culprits, solving cases... That's what a detective is.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:09.460
If we solve more cases and become excellent detectives, I'm sure we'll be able to save the academy.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:12.630
Becoming farmers was a mistake.

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:17.840
We'll be able to save the academy by becoming excellent detectives!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.470
You just realized that?

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.140
Let's vow upon the Great Kamakura Detective!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.510
We'll solve more cases,

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.510
become excellent detectives,

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.980
and protect Holmes Detective Academy!

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:49.410
What now? Milky Holmes blew up Kamakura's Great Detective!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.410
Arrest without warrant and trial.

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.250
Let's lock them up.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:57.460
No wonder Detective Holmes Academy has no future with such useless students running around.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:00.800
It's a little late, but I feel sorry for the student council president, Henriette.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.550
The future for the Academy looks totally hopeless.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.760
"Hope" isn't in Henriette's dictionary!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.270
Next time: And Then Hope Was Gone.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.270
It's fine if the culprit is Kokoro-san, right?

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:11.810
Sure.

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:12.940
No objections.
